15 0 obj
<< /A 36 0 R /Alt (Flowchart depicting study selection process. Initially, 228 studies were identified from databases: Pubmed \(86\), Cochrane Library \(17\), J-Dream III \(123\), UMIN-CTR \(0\), ICTRP \(2\). After removal of duplicates, 187 studies remained and eight studies were selected and incorporated into this meta-analysis. IPD were obtained from seven studies. For one study, IPD were not obtained due to no reply.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 27 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (Forest plots showing the standardized mean differences \(SMD\) for two sets of studies. \(A\) includes studies from Sugimura \(2013, 2015\), Suzuki \(2015\), Fujii \(2017\), and Komano \(2018, 2023\), with an overall SMD of 0.37. \(B\) has studies from Sugimura \(2013\), Suzuki \(2015\), Shibata \(2016\), and Komano \(2018, 2023\), with an overall SMD of 0.47. Both plots display confidence intervals, weights, and heterogeneity statistics.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Forest plots showing the mean differences \(MD\) for cumulative number of days of common cold-like symptoms; \(A\) sore throat, \(B\) runny nose, \(C\) cough, \(D\) feverishness. Figures contain MD, 95%CI, heterogeneity.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
